<title>UK: Rabobank sets 500 billion lire zero coupon bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 500 billion lire zero coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rabobank Nederland BA has launched a 500 billion lire 20-year zero coupon bond priced at 19.55, lead manager Credito Italiano said. The deal is being reoffered at 17.65. Fees total two points.  </p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT    500 BLN LIRE  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY   *20.OCT.16</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  19.55     PAY DATE    21.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    17.65     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NETHS     HOME CTRY  NETHS     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  1.90	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALL AT 41.89 ON 20.OCT.06.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
